  "narration": [
    {
      "id": "moon",
      "text": "今天晚上，很好的月光。",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/moon.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "dc472ad47562cee1bfe63b4fcc765c11f491a470bafbbe30d19d8d4cd3528efb",
      "startFrame": 114,
      "startSample": 228000,
      "endSample": 389344,
      "sourceSamples": 161344,
      "gain": 0.812233589892627,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.328000000000003,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "dog",
      "text": "然而须十分小心。不然，那赵家的狗，何以看我两眼呢？",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/dog.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "72e211a0cfc042e48804ae153ff1b8a1d7e30850def62c6e38d1b6908c0511b4",
      "startFrame": 231,
      "startSample": 462000,
      "endSample": 825026,
      "sourceSamples": 363026,
      "gain": 0.5618655692729767,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.486999999999995,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "zhao",
      "text": "早上小心出门，赵贵翁的眼色便怪：似乎怕我，似乎想害我。",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/zhao.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "1c6b3c5a5893ecac5e8c5746df8d5a558a5f8f6fd153e645dda073d1dabc0cd5",
      "startFrame": 466,
      "startSample": 932000,
      "endSample": 1371664,
      "sourceSamples": 439664,
      "gain": 0.6684176430981796,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.168000000000006,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "whisper",
      "text": "还有七八个人，交头接耳的议论我。又怕我看见。",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/whisper.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "42b571b14687d3d30ef9e5d58165509535077363ce646650624e5599723c8ab2",
      "startFrame": 712,
      "startSample": 1424000,
      "endSample": 1718454,
      "sourceSamples": 294454,
      "gain": 0.6099776619508563,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.772999999999996,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "smile",
      "text": "其中最凶的一个人，张着嘴，对我笑了一笑；我便从头直冷到脚跟。",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/smile.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "0e4bf6b55e449de786d3451a831cd613febde0f7e8c202c4d1c0199bd64e8d15",
      "startFrame": 886,
      "startSample": 1772000,
      "endSample": 2167294,
      "sourceSamples": 395294,
      "gain": 0.5053514697264119,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.353000000000009,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "lock",
      "text": "陈老五赶上前，硬把我拖回家中了。进了书房，便反扣上门，宛然是关了一只鸡鸭。",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/lock.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "e3649104c92390f32fb282dadc5821e0704f878ce74de9398cb01c7a5fa2344b",
      "startFrame": 1128,
      "startSample": 2256000,
      "endSample": 2639194,
      "sourceSamples": 383194,
      "gain": 0.6250710121005215,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.402999999999992,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "history-a",
      "text": "我翻开历史一查，这历史没有年代，",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/history-a.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "00ca1e3d8e97840e625c92dbdb5eff98de124097448261ac354f3988add7004b",
      "startFrame": 1376,
      "startSample": 2752000,
      "endSample": 2953680,
      "sourceSamples": 201680,
      "gain": 0.600740659260074,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.159999999999997,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "history-b",
      "text": "歪歪斜斜的每叶上都写着“仁义道德”几个字。",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/history-b.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "0ba0a6e79bd78b0873d1869773d07eed2cb1796d3bcf34cc885ae4121f4c3a75",
      "startFrame": 1498,
      "startSample": 2996000,
      "endSample": 3254152,
      "sourceSamples": 258152,
      "gain": 0.6027267889765611,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.924000000000007,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "history-c",
      "text": "我横竖睡不着，仔细看了半夜，才从字缝里看出字来，满本都写着两个字是“吃人”！",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/history-c.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "9ff99bd0f9f1585babded3214be00ceae699e93d3a27f89a795e73b0db8a77ec",
      "startFrame": 1649,
      "startSample": 3298000,
      "endSample": 3685226,
      "sourceSamples": 387226,
      "gain": 0.5541312950248588,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.387,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "fish",
      "text": "陈老五送进饭来，一碗菜，一碗蒸鱼；这鱼的眼睛，白而且硬，张着嘴，同那一伙想吃人的人一样。",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/fish.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "cf04b5243edbc23e6299657444762f72b03afc6280d3468ae925bc33a880bc56",
      "startFrame": 1898,
      "startSample": 3796000,
      "endSample": 4320370,
      "sourceSamples": 524370,
      "gain": 0.5906911345855717,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.814999999999998,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "brother",
      "text": "大哥说：“今天请何先生来，给你诊一诊。”我说：“可以！”",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/brother.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "a38c49b222eeda4f9c5627b9285a42603af82d99e5d06a6733b963806104ff94",
      "startFrame": 2210,
      "startSample": 4420000,
      "endSample": 4718488,
      "sourceSamples": 298488,
      "gain": 0.7419617788243819,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.756,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "doctor",
      "text": "老头子坐着，闭了眼睛，摸了好一会，呆了好一会；便张开他鬼眼睛说：“不要乱想。静静的养几天，就好了。”",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/doctor.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "e6fa293b6388b401a9b0d94032faf138d26857663fc3ce717db1a86da3fb3d98",
      "startFrame": 2393,
      "startSample": 4786000,
      "endSample": 5378942,
      "sourceSamples": 592942,
      "gain": 0.5372331704757844,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.528999999999996,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "aside",
      "text": "老头子跨出门，走不多远，便低声对大哥说道，“赶紧吃罢！”大哥点点头。",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/aside.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "c4e5d9dc5fb6bf7fab7a3ad29646a6f819cee93fae65a2985d081eca896f4e30",
      "startFrame": 2747,
      "startSample": 5494000,
      "endSample": 5828790,
      "sourceSamples": 334790,
      "gain": 0.7056155114152166,
      "peakTarget": 0.46,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.60499999999999,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "question",
      "text": "从来如此，便对么？",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/question.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "20f28a2233f0e16e0b21b80fc34af5a23c00730691c652c6f1fe7f48a73d5c62",
      "startFrame": 2983,
      "startSample": 5966000,
      "endSample": 6087008,
      "sourceSamples": 121008,
      "gain": 0.4858744051250127,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.496000000000002,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "madman-name",
      "text": "“都出去！疯子有什么好看！”",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/madman-name.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "4d276ceee68d3d05232f1580e91236e9ecae0bee8a516aba75d28f691da76d1b",
      "startFrame": 3114,
      "startSample": 6228000,
      "endSample": 6349008,
      "sourceSamples": 121008,
      "gain": 0.48143388488756106,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.496000000000002,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "label",
      "text": "他们岂但不肯改，而且早已布置；预备下一个疯子的名目罩上我。",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/label.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "369d5c526f77051da820da3bffdc6129ed2dfbb9778236eb3ade6a5edc517c6f",
      "startFrame": 3202,
      "startSample": 6404000,
      "endSample": 6771058,
      "sourceSamples": 367058,
      "gain": 0.628603351034314,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.471000000000004,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "beams",
      "text": "横梁和椽子都在头上发抖；抖了一会，就大起来，堆在我身上。",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/beams.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "97097a6a4ed24c09dd3f3ad8b30f2a56241e61e6fa51037fd715795a8860a409",
      "startFrame": 3432,
      "startSample": 6864000,
      "endSample": 7162488,
      "sourceSamples": 298488,
      "gain": 0.6575334047516905,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.756,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "false-weight",
      "text": "我晓得他的沉重是假的，便挣扎出来，出了一身汗。",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/false-weight.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "dc658dcfdb34b88e3560a7f581bc18c0e6bbecf19ec168be9589603eb1370ce3",
      "startFrame": 3610,
      "startSample": 7220000,
      "endSample": 7453950,
      "sourceSamples": 233950,
      "gain": 0.5587786841249479,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.025000000000006,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "self-a",
      "text": "四千年来时时吃人的地方，",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/self-a.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "54d8ec84b5eddc0037620da2dea39b1b644301973018e9a62499e214131dbbc4",
      "startFrame": 3794,
      "startSample": 7588000,
      "endSample": 7725142,
      "sourceSamples": 137142,
      "gain": 0.8920938225810569,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.429000000000002,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "self-b",
      "text": "今天才明白，我也在其中混了多年；",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/self-b.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "361e0276856b4626a616335807a8515e0180005442654ce4e90c505b70f115ee",
      "startFrame": 3888,
      "startSample": 7776000,
      "endSample": 7989782,
      "sourceSamples": 213782,
      "gain": 0.6649350649350649,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.108999999999995,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "children",
      "text": "没有吃过人的孩子，或者还有？",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/children.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "aea6544c5c92be7edd7a88acc6db66812e037a22ff248517b9e33cf8531d89d1",
      "startFrame": 4056,
      "startSample": 8112000,
      "endSample": 8309648,
      "sourceSamples": 197648,
      "gain": 0.507261912428679,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.176000000000002,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "plea",
      "text": "救救孩子……",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/plea.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "5489b211ea52d8d178dd218f0b5f569ac4b7c04f334acee139d7e26b1d64ab67",
      "startFrame": 4211,
      "startSample": 8422000,
      "endSample": 8502672,
      "sourceSamples": 80672,
      "gain": 0.8338944581649528,
      "peakTarget": 0.5,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.664000000000001,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    },
    {
      "id": "cured",
      "text": "劳君远道来视，然已早愈，赴某地候补矣。",
      "sourcePath": "public/madman/voice-v5/cured.wav",
      "sourceSha256": "5e35f77cf7086fe598078f3b374f4e23d6b0d05a4d24e335812a410e3f9d2c73",
      "startFrame": 4362,
      "startSample": 8724000,
      "endSample": 8970050,
      "sourceSamples": 246050,
      "gain": 0.7420780170840499,
      "peakTarget": 0.46,
      "captionMarginFrames": 8.974999999999994,
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
      "voice": "longsanshu_v3"
    }
  ],
